# clamber-scenario v1
id: roll-flat
summary: Walk right on flat ground, roll with a one-frame Action press, then keep walking through the stop after the roll.
requires: flat ground, at least 240 px clear ahead, no entities or carryable objects within 280 px
start: grounded, idle for at least 30 frames, facing right, lead character
frames: 100

[inputs]
0-99     R
30       A

[metrics]
roll_distance    tol 0.5
top_speed        tol 0.0625
final_x          tol 1
curve x,vx from roll_start for 40 tol 0.25
